OL,3,AIs Vine back? Short-form video-sharing
OL,4,Aapp Divine opens to public
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new app seen as a spiritual successor
OL,7,Fto short-form video service Vine has
OL,8,Fbeen released to the public.
OL,10,FMuch like the original, Divine lets
OL,11,Fusers create and share videos which are
OL,12,Fjust six seconds long and repeat on a
OL,13,Floop.
OL,15,FThe new app also hosts more than two
OL,16,Fmillion original Vine videos and - in a
OL,17,Fbid to further distance itself from
OL,18,Fother platforms - bans content made by
OL,19,FAI.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/18
