OL,3,AViral 'Cat in the Hat' TikTok trend
OL,4,Asparks fun fake videos but also real
OL,5,Afear
OL,6,
OL,7,F"He's so scary!" says 16-year-old Skye,
OL,8,Frecoiling at the mention of the Cat in
OL,9,Fthe Hat.
OL,11,FViral images purporting to show a
OL,12,Flife-sized version of the Dr Seuss
OL,13,Fcharacter on the streets after dark
OL,14,Fhave sparked fear and confusion among
OL,15,Fteenagers.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11911
SC,0011
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1787570316
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AViral 'Cat in the Hat' TikTok trend
OL,4,Asparks fun fake videos but also real
OL,5,Afear
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe posts, seen by millions, have
OL,8,Fconvinced some young people that the
OL,9,Fcharacter is real and that they might
OL,10,Fencounter it, prompting police forces
OL,11,Fin Ireland and the UK to issue
OL,12,Fstatements confirming that the images
OL,13,Fand videos are fake.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11912
SC,0012
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1787570316
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AViral 'Cat in the Hat' TikTok trend
OL,4,Asparks fun fake videos but also real
OL,5,Afear
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I was having a sleepover," Skye
OL,8,Felaborates, "but everyone started
OL,9,Fwatching Cat in the Hat videos. It was
OL,10,F3am. I wanted to go home. When I
OL,11,Fstarted walking down my friends'
OL,12,Fdriveway, I got totally freaked out
OL,13,Fthat the Cat in the Hat was going to
OL,14,Fjump out. I had to call my mum to pick
OL,15,Fme up."
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
